### Rol, roles asignables y permisos de Jobs de una persona (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/getRolesAndPermissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 3096
}

### Uno mismo: canEdit = false y ningún permiso con canChange (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/getRolesAndPermissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": {{myUserId}}
}

### Persona de nivel Sistema, Asesor u Operador → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/getRolesAndPermissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": 2
}
